 lost the Holy Land but gained immense wealth and autonomy—enough to frighten a deeply indebted king. Under torture, accusations of heresy, idol worship, and secret rituals were extracted, leading to decades of trials and executions. Although medieval chronicles rarely link the date itself with superstition, later historians, and novelists retroactively wove this betrayal into a broader myth, transforming a bureaucratic act of greed into a symbol of cosmic bad luck. ID X and the superstition", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-28T18:22:04Z", "username": "Nikhil Borra", "text": "Templar", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-28T18:22:05Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "templar", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-28T18:22:06Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "knights", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-28T18:22:09Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "friday 13", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-28T18:22:11Z", "username": "Srijan Naayak", "text": "Friday", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-28T18:22:14Z", "username": "Srijan Naayak", "text": "13th", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-28T18:22:34Z", "username": "Sidhesh K K", "text": "Templar knights and Friday the 13 is correct", "role": "confirmation", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-28T18:22:57Z", "username": "Sidhesh K K", "text": "Apratim 5, Pavan 50, Srijan 15, KP 5, Nikhil 5", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}]